## 5. Modern UI Styling Rules

* **Visual Beat Separation:** Adding a wider pixel gap ($12\text{px}$) after steps 4, 8, and 12 instantly gives users visual feedback matching quarter-note time signatures.
* **Color Hierarchy:**
* Inactive Steps: `#1E222B` (Dark Slate)
* Standard Active Steps: `#00E5FF` (Cyan Accent)
* Roll Subdivisions & Pitch Sweeps: `#FF0055` (Hot Pink Badge)
